\[\left( y + 2 - \frac{y^2 + yT - T^2}{T - y} \right)^2 + \left( T - \frac{y^2 + yT - T^2}{T - y} \right)^2 = \left( \frac{y^2 + yT - T^2}{T - y} \right)^2.\]This simplifies as
